<title>USA: Individual Inc names Kolowich Pres/CEO.</title>
<headline>Individual Inc names Kolowich Pres/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Individual Inc said Monday its directors named Michael E. Kolowich president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Kolowich succeeds Rosi Amram, who continues as an Individual director, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Kolowich was president and founder of AT&amp;T Corp's AT&amp;T New Media Services. AT&amp;T New Media recently merged with Industry.Net Corp to form a new company,  Nets Inc, where Kolowich was vice president, business operations.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
